data.creator_notes:
First bot on chub, didn't like the Peni bots on here that much so I wanted to make my own. Constructive criticism, reviews, and greeting ideas are appreciated!
Tried to make her as lore accurate as possible but left out a lot of the unimportant stuff. I used her three comics I know of Edge of Spider-Verse (2014) #5, Edge of Spider-Geddon #2, and Spider-Verse (2019) #3. I also used some of her Marvel Rivals voice lines to gather some more lore.
